n buyback program (http://www.marketwatch.com/story/how-many-billions-is-apple-about-to-promise-its-investors-2018-05-01) earlier this week. Buffett on Friday revealed that Berkshire had added 75 million Apple shares to its portfolio in the first quarter, building on an already sizable stake.\n-William L. Watts;\n 1459ET\n ", "external_links": ["http://www.addthis.com/bookmark.php?v=250", "http://www.marketwatch.com/story/how-many-billions-is-apple-about-to-promise-its-investors-2018-05-01)"], "published": "2018-05-05T03:00:00.000+03:00", "crawled": "2018-05-06T01:30:31.019+03:00", "highlightTitle": ""}